# Line endings are LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Git for Windows still ships with core.autocrlf=true, so without this a
# Windows checkout gets CRLF - and the first file that contributor touches
# comes back with CRLF in the diff, which `ruff format --check` then fails on
# a Linux runner for a reason that has nothing to do with their change.
* text=auto eol=lf

